{"seq":1,"slug":"model-optimization","title":"模型压缩与量化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/deployment/model-optimization","wordCount":1107,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"模型压缩与量化\">模型压缩与量化</h1><p>一个在 A100 上跑 53 mAP 的检测模型，部署到手机上可能只剩 20 FPS 和 45 mAP。模型压缩与量化的目标是在可接受的精度损失（通常 &lt;1%）下，将模型的计算量、内存占用和延迟压缩到目标硬件可承受的范围。本文覆盖 CV 模型部署中最核心的压缩技术栈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>模型压缩是一个多维度优化问题，不同技术可组合使用：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[原始模型] --&gt; B[量化 Quantization]&#10;    A --&gt; C[剪枝 Pruning]&#10;    A --&gt; D[知识蒸馏 Distillation]&#10;    A --&gt; E[架构搜索 NAS]&#10;    B --&gt; F[部署模型]&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[目标硬件推理]\">graph TD\n    A[原始模型] --&gt; B[量化 Quantization]\n    A --&gt; C[剪枝 Pruning]\n    A --&gt; D[知识蒸馏 Distillation]\n    A --&gt; E[架构搜索 NAS]\n    B --&gt; F[部署模型]\n    C --&gt; F\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[目标硬件推理]</pre><p>各技术的压缩效果与代价对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>模型大小压缩</th>\n<th>速度提升</th>\n<th>精度损失</th>\n<th>额外训练</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>INT8 量化（PTQ）</td>\n<td>4x</td>\n<td>2-4x</td>\n<td>&lt;0.5%</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT4 量化</td>\n<td>8x</td>\n<td>3-6x</td>\n<td>1-3%</td>\n<td>推荐 QAT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构化剪枝</td>\n<td>2-5x</td>\n<td>2-4x</td>\n<td>1-2%</td>\n<td>需要微调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>知识蒸馏</td>\n<td>自定义</td>\n<td>自定义</td>\n<td>可忽略</td>\n<td>需要完整训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NAS 轻量架构</td>\n<td>设计决定</td>\n<td>设计决定</td>\n<td>0%</td>\n<td>搜索 + 训练</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"量化-精度换速度的工程标准\">量化：精度换速度的工程标准</h2><p>量化将 FP32 权重/激活值映射到低位宽整数（INT8/INT4），利用硬件 INT8/INT4 计算单元加速推理。</p>\n<p><strong>线性量化公式：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>s</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_q = \\text{round}\\left(\\frac{x}{s}\\right) + z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.836em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{dequant} = s \\cdot (x_q - z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 是缩放因子（scale），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 是零点（zero-point）。</p>\n<p><strong>对称量化 vs 非对称量化：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>对称：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，范围 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-\\alpha, \\alpha]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，适合权重</li>\n<li>非对称：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z \\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，范围 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>β</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\beta, \\alpha]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，适合 ReLU 后的激活（非负）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>PTQ（训练后量化）工程流程：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>准备校准数据集（100-1000 张代表性图像）</li>\n<li>运行模型前向传播，收集每层激活的统计信息（min/max 或直方图）</li>\n<li>计算最优 scale/zero-point（MinMax / Percentile / MSE 最小化）</li>\n<li>导出量化模型（TensorRT / ONNX Runtime / OpenVINO）</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>QAT（量化感知训练）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>在训练期间模拟量化误差（fake quantization）</li>\n<li>模型学会适应量化噪声，精度损失更小</li>\n<li>适用于 PTQ 精度损失不可接受的场景（如 INT4）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>混合精度量化：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>不是所有层对量化同样敏感</li>\n<li>第一层/最后一层/注意力层通常保留 FP16</li>\n<li>中间卷积层量化为 INT8</li>\n<li>工具：TensorRT 自动混合精度、ONNX Runtime 的 layer-wise 配置</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"结构化剪枝\">结构化剪枝</h2><p>剪枝的目标是移除&quot;不重要&quot;的参数，减少计算量：</p>\n<p><strong>非结构化剪枝（Unstructured）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>将小于阈值的单个权重置零</li>\n<li>产生稀疏矩阵，需要特殊硬件支持（如 NVIDIA A100 的 2:4 稀疏）</li>\n<li>高压缩率但实际加速依赖硬件</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>结构化剪枝（Structured）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>移除整个卷积核/通道/注意力头</li>\n<li>产生更小的规则模型，直接在所有硬件上加速</li>\n<li>重要性评估：L1-norm / Taylor 展开 / 梯度-权重乘积</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>LAMP（Layer-Adaptive Magnitude Pruning）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>考虑每层对全局损失的敏感度</li>\n<li>自适应分配每层的剪枝率</li>\n<li>YOLOv11 + LAMP 可在减少 34% 参数的同时保持 95%+ mAP</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"知识蒸馏\">知识蒸馏</h2><p>用大模型（Teacher）的输出监督小模型（Student）的训练：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L} = \\alpha \\cdot \\mathcal{L}_{task}(y, \\hat{y}_{student}) + (1-\\alpha) \\cdot \\mathcal{L}_{KD}(\\hat{y}_{teacher}, \\hat{y}_{student})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>CV 中的蒸馏策略：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>蒸馏类型</th>\n<th>监督信号</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输出蒸馏</td>\n<td>Teacher 的 logits</td>\n<td>分类任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征蒸馏</td>\n<td>中间层特征图</td>\n<td>检测/分割（需要空间信息）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注意力蒸馏</td>\n<td>注意力图</td>\n<td>ViT 到轻量 ViT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关系蒸馏</td>\n<td>样本间关系矩阵</td>\n<td>少样本/度量学习</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>典型配置：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Teacher: YOLOv11-X（mAP 56.1）</li>\n<li>Student: YOLOv11-N（mAP 39.5 → 蒸馏后 43.2）</li>\n<li>温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = 4-20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span>（软化 Teacher 输出分布）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"量化工具链选型\">量化工具链选型</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>后端</th>\n<th>量化方式</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TensorRT</td>\n<td>NVIDIA GPU</td>\n<td>PTQ INT8 / FP16</td>\n<td>GPU 推理最快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ONNX Runtime</td>\n<td>多平台</td>\n<td>PTQ INT8 / QDQ</td>\n<td>跨平台兼容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OpenVINO</td>\n<td>Intel CPU/GPU/VPU</td>\n<td>PTQ INT8 / NNCF</td>\n<td>Intel 硬件最优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Core ML</td>\n<td>Apple NPU</td>\n<td>Palettization / INT8</td>\n<td>iOS 集成最佳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TFLite</td>\n<td>ARM CPU / GPU</td>\n<td>PTQ INT8 / FP16</td>\n<td>Android 标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NCNN</td>\n<td>ARM CPU</td>\n<td>手动优化</td>\n<td>极致移动端</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>INT8 PTQ 是 CV 模型部署的&quot;免费午餐&quot;——几乎无精度损失换 2-4 倍加速</li>\n<li>量化敏感层保留高精度（混合精度）是实用策略</li>\n<li>结构化剪枝产生真正更小的模型，无需稀疏硬件支持</li>\n<li>知识蒸馏可在不改架构的情况下提升小模型精度 3-5 个百分点</li>\n<li>工具链选型跟着目标硬件走——TensorRT (GPU) / OpenVINO (Intel) / Core ML (Apple)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>下一篇 <a href=\"edge-inference\">边缘设备推理</a> 将量化模型真正部署到端侧</li>\n<li>跨库参考：大模型量化的通用方法论见 <a href=\"../../nlp-transformers/engineering/inference-optimization\">推理优化</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"模型压缩与量化","id":"模型压缩与量化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"量化：精度换速度的工程标准","id":"量化-精度换速度的工程标准"},{"level":2,"text":"结构化剪枝","id":"结构化剪枝"},{"level":2,"text":"知识蒸馏","id":"知识蒸馏"},{"level":2,"text":"量化工具链选型","id":"量化工具链选型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"图像编辑与可控生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/generation/image-editing"},"next":{"title":"边缘设备推理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/deployment/edge-inference"}}